1
00:00:00,962 --> 00:00:02,262
(Howard:)Okay, I gotta ask...

2
00:00:02,263 --> 00:00:04,033
(Howard:)why are you wearing
a bow tie?

3
00:00:04,031 --> 00:00:06,971
(Sheldon:)I've never applied
for a patent before.

4
00:00:06,968 --> 00:00:08,798
(Sheldon:)I wanted to make
a good impression.

5
00:00:08,803 --> 00:00:12,073
Oh. Is the impression that
your first name is Pee-Wee?

6
00:00:12,073 --> 00:00:14,243
(chuckling)

7
00:00:17,211 --> 00:00:19,811
(Sheldon:)Yeah, well, you're an engineer.

8
00:00:19,814 --> 00:00:21,414
(Sheldon:)End of joke, burn.

9
00:00:24,252 --> 00:00:25,482
(Attorney:)Come on in, fellas.

10
00:00:25,486 --> 00:00:27,486
(Howard:)See, he's not wearing a tie.

11
00:00:27,488 --> 00:00:28,718
(Leonard:)Well, he's
a patent attorney.

12
00:00:28,723 --> 00:00:30,593
(Leonard:)Maybe his tie is pending.

13
00:00:31,759 --> 00:00:33,929
(Attorney:)So, I've reviewed
your paperwork,

14
00:00:33,928 --> 00:00:36,228
(Attorney:)and it seems like
we've got everything we need

15
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:37,300
(Attorney:)to file a patent

16
00:00:37,298 --> 00:00:39,328
(Attorney:)for your infinite
persistence gyroscope.

17
00:00:39,333 --> 00:00:40,433
That's great!
Excellent.

18
00:00:40,434 --> 00:00:41,804
(Leonard:)So what happens next?

19
00:00:41,802 --> 00:00:43,272
(Attorney:)Well, the legal team
needs to review

20
00:00:43,271 --> 00:00:45,201
(Attorney:)existing patents
to avoid overlap.

21
00:00:45,206 --> 00:00:46,706
(Howard:)Oh, I don't think
there will be.

22
00:00:46,707 --> 00:00:48,207
Yes, we did
our own search.

23
00:00:48,209 --> 00:00:51,509
(Attorney:)That's nice, but I think ours
might be a bit more thorough.

